site}}_{⏟}}_{Q(x)}\n$$\n\nwhich corresponds to $Q(x)⇒P(x).$ $\\,\\times $\n\n- Option III reads\n\n$$\n{{x\\text{ is composite,}}_{⏟}}_{Q(x)}\\,\\text{provided that}\\,{{4\\,|\\,x}_{⏟}}_{P(x)}\n$$\n\nwhich corresponds to $P(x)⇒Q(x).$ $\\,✓$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186421149 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186198284 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b24ae815-5706-5b65-bab8-2d67f8405c9c" :knowledge-point/title "\"Whenever\", and \"Provided That\""}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a4af447c-137a-5206-8f45-b1d092bcb140" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474608} {:answer/id #uuid "ab8c70f1-dcc6-5193-8f60-c456fab1f222" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474609}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ab8c70f1-dcc6-5193-8f60-c456fab1f222" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474609} :answer-field/id #uuid "37d6042b-bd9e-5bc2-bf5e-088b73f1ee19" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475230} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ffbb1415-92c3-5383-a457-97467be78458" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474610} {:answer/id #uuid "e54dd938-883f-5763-8889-7d44c7efebd1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474611}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e54dd938-883f-5763-8889-7d44c7efebd1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474611} :answer-field/id #uuid "510e11c1-b41d-553e-8bcf